sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant EC as E-commerce
    participant OMS as Order Management
    participant RS as Reservation Service
    participant DB as Authoritative Inventory Store
    participant EP as Event Publisher
    participant EV as Event Distribution
    participant OIV as Online Inventory View

    Customer->>EC: Place order
    EC->>OMS: Submit order request
    OMS->>RS: Reserve inventory (idempotency key)
    RS->>DB: Atomic allocation + reservation + outbox record

    alt Inventory available
        DB-->>RS: Transaction committed
        RS-->>OMS: Reservation confirmed
        OMS-->>EC: Order accepted
        EC-->>Customer: Confirmation
        EP->>DB: Read pending outbox event
        DB-->>EP: InventoryReserved event
        EP->>EV: Publish event
        EV-->>EP: Publication acknowledged
        EP->>DB: Mark event published
        EV->>OIV: Deliver InventoryReserved
        OIV-->>EV: Processing acknowledged
    else Insufficient inventory
        DB-->>RS: Allocation rejected
        RS-->>OMS: Insufficient inventory
        OMS-->>EC: Order cannot be fulfilled
        EC-->>Customer: Display unavailable
    end

    Note over RS,DB: Atomic transaction prevents conflicting allocations
    Note over EP,OIV: Delivery may be repeated; consumers must be idempotent
